version: "2.0"
date-released: "2026-09-13"
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 / Mathlib formalizations of two solutions of Erdős Problem 289:
  Erdos289CLT/ verifies the theorem of "Separated intervals with reciprocal sum one"
  (Cambie, Land, Tang), and Erdos289/ verifies the earlier stronger statement with
  intervals of length two or three inside [1, 20k] (Land). Both terminal theorems
  depend only on the axioms propext, Classical.choice and Quot.sound.
keywords:
  - Erdős problems
  - Egyptian fractions
  - Lean 4
  - Mathlib
  - formal verification
